{"4952020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ouroboros Break", "steam_appid": 4952020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras/176805e23d7926bef2306ef882769b00.avif?t=1785280929\" width=1500 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impossible architecture stretches across the horizon.</strong> Twisted creatures roam corrupted landscapes. Reality itself bends and tears apart, revealing unnatural glitches where magic has begun to consume the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an infinitely generated open world where no journey is ever the same.</strong> Traverse ruined cities, geometric forests, abandoned churches, forgotten labyrinths, and countless other corrupted regions. Return to a familiar path and discover it has shifted. Hallways twist into new destinations, landmarks reveal hidden routes, and the world constantly rearranges itself as the corruption spreads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt down the powerful beings responsible for the corruption</strong> and fight through cinematic boss encounters that stand between you and the truth. Every victory pushes you deeper into a world that becomes stranger, more dangerous, and increasingly impossible to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on what you can recover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect the bones of fallen enemies and construct your own modular skeletal minions.</strong> Assemble up to four companions, customize their equipment and combat roles, and command them as extensions of your own fighting style. They aren't just allies—they become part of your attacks, your strategy, and your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every expedition is a gamble.</strong> Venture into the unknown to recover powerful weapons, rare bones, and valuable resources before extracting back to your sanctuary. Anything carried into the world is lost when you fall, including every minion fighting beside you. Decide how much you're willing to risk for the chance to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras/fd35b1b73bc5c679151e049c331bff30.avif?t=1785280929\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras_big/fd35b1b73bc5c679151e049c331bff30.webp?t=1785280929 width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras/b44cb7cc7a3fdc2639b6f0931048400b.avif?t=1785280929\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras_big/b44cb7cc7a3fdc2639b6f0931048400b.webp?t=1785280929 width=1560 height=68 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a procedurally generated open world where regions shift, routes change, and every expedition offers new discoveries while major landmarks guide you toward powerful bosses.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras/387e28c8fdf04f1c4bae144ce75caf1a.avif?t=1785280929\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras_big/387e28c8fdf04f1c4bae144ce75caf1a.webp?t=1785280929 width=1560 height=68 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect bones from defeated enemies and create up to four fully customizable skeletal companions, each equipped with different weapons, roles, and abilities.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras/798665eac7062460cf1a507431cc2af6.avif?t=1785280929\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras_big/798665eac7062460cf1a507431cc2af6.webp?t=1785280929 width=1560 height=68 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together melee attacks, perfectly timed dodges, and coordinated minion abilities to create fluid, stylish combat that rewards aggression and precision.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras/40426c742ac56b170352efe63ef8d0d5.avif?t=1785280929\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras_big/40426c742ac56b170352efe63ef8d0d5.webp?t=1785280929 width=1560 height=68 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover powerful loot and escape safely to strengthen your growing army. Death means losing your equipment, your companions, and everything they carried into the expedition.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras/cd8360acdd2ac059294061cee197a6a7.avif?t=1785280929\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras_big/cd8360acdd2ac059294061cee197a6a7.webp?t=1785280929 width=1560 height=68 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge handcrafted bosses inspired by classic action RPGs, each with unique mechanics, multiple attack patterns, and memorable set-piece battles.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras/c585db37c544aea5c48fc99001e189d7.avif?t=1785280929\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras_big/c585db37c544aea5c48fc99001e189d7.webp?t=1785280929 width=1560 height=68 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic is feared as corruption, but the impossible glitches spreading throughout the world hint at something far stranger lurking beneath the surface.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras/26ff17c485a1273f865cb906be14158a.avif?t=1785280929\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras_big/26ff17c485a1273f865cb906be14158a.webp?t=1785280929 width=1560 height=68 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new weapons, collect different bones, experiment with minion builds, and develop your own combat style across countless expeditions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world is broken.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic has corrupted reality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The deeper you travel, the less the world obeys its own rules.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952020/extras/176805e23d7926bef2306ef882769b00.avif?t=1785280929\" width=1500 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p